<title>USA: L.A. T says plaintiff drops lawsuit.</title>
<headline>L.A. T says plaintiff drops lawsuit.</headline>
<dateline>BALL GROUND, Ga. 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>L.A. T Sportswear Inc said on Friday that Omega Partners LP had agreed to drop its lawsuit against L.A. T.</p>
<p>In May 1995 Omega filed a purported class action suit against L.A. T, its executives and the underwriter of its initial public offering, alleging that the offering documents contained a material omission.</p>
